    36	ring `A`. It stabilizes at some finite `D*`; equivalently the
    37	closed images `X_D = closure(pi_A(V_D))` descend and stabilize.
    38	Mod `p` the windows are finite sets, so a descending chain of
    39	nonempty images has nonempty inverse limit (König): **all depths
    40	nonempty ⟺ a mod-p formal germ exists.** The mechanism is
    41	exact-verified on a toy tower (gate DS2: `J_1 = (0) ⊊ J_2 ∋ b⁴−a³`).
