+/-!
+# Solution placeholder: depth-window witness
+
+The phase-2 deliverable is definition-only.  `Challenge` contains the
+kernel-checked structural model and the parameterized proposition
+`JC72108.DepthWitness.HasDepthWitness`.  No nonemptiness theorem is copied
+here: the witness proof (or the depth-25 emptiness theorem) waits for the
+campaign's D25 verdict and a matching certificate.
