+/-- Ten new tail coordinates on which Row_22 is affine. -/
+inductive D23Tail
+  | tg02_54 | tg01_54 | tg2_49 | tg1_49 | tg1_54
+  | tg2_54 | tf1_54 | tf2_54 | tf1_49 | tf2_49
+  deriving DecidableEq, Repr
