+| `throughFactor` | `r1_experiment.py` lines 522–527 | Exact `eta - Y_tilde` factor normalized at level 32. |
+| `offFactor` | same, lines 528–537 | Exact `P_arc-C_phase Y + eta*t^20` factor. |
