+| `gLead_value` | same | Division-free equality `gLead*2^9=-7^18`. |
+| `lead_tower_relation` | DirectionB lines 86–92 | Kernel check of `gLead^2=fLead^3` in the `s0=1` gauge. |
+
+## Template ladder and tower
+
