+| `offFactor` | same, lines 528–537 | Exact `P_arc-C_phase Y + eta*t^20` factor. |
+| `orbitFactors` | same, lines 515–538 | Seven directions and `orbitSize/7` subbranches, with `phase=k+7j`. |
+| `orbitJet` | same | Product for one orbit. |
